---
---
<section id="bienvenidos" class="reveal relative w-full bg-[#F3EDEB]">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:py-14 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:gap-1">
      <!-- Texto -->
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <h2 class="font-serif font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-[#2E3F51]">
          BIENVENIDOS
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#333] leading-relaxed">
          <p>Las historias más poderosas no se repiten. <br> <span class="font-semibold text-1.5xl">¡Se viven una sola vez!</span></p>
          <p>Trabajamos con personas y marcas que saben que la imagen no es un accesorio, es legado, posicionamiento y memoria.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 md:justify-start">
          <a href="#contacto" class="rounded-full bg-[#2E3F51] px-5 py-2 text-xs font-sans font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-white transition hover:bg-[#213142] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#C7D8E4]">Contactanos</a>
           <a href="/#galeria" class="rounded-full border border-[#2E3F51] px-5 py-2 text-xs font-sans font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[#2E3F51] transition hover:bg-[#2E3F51] hover:text-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#C7D8E4]">Ver portafolio</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Video vertical -->
      <div class="w-[300px] justify-self-center md:justify-self-center">
        <div class="relative aspect-7/16 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black shadow-lg ring-1 ring-black/5">
          <video class="h-full w-full object-cover" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-label="Reel vertical de bienvenida">
            <source src="/VIDEOS/Reel.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
            Tu navegador no soporta video HTML5.
          </video>
          <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/20 to-transparent"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-10 text-center font-serif text-sm sm:text-base text-[#2E3F51]/80">Los sueños si se cumplen</p>
  </div>
</section>
